<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech sell/buy tender yields 18.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech sell/buy tender yields 18.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield in a Czech finance ministry sell and buy tender on Friday was the same as the maximum set limit on bids of 18.5 percent, the Czech National Bank said.</p>
<p>It said that it accepted 80 percent of bids made at that level, but total volume on the transactions was not released. The finance ministry has been using the tenders to close gaps in funding the state sector operating budget.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
